  "simplified": [
    "The open court retains the side colonnades, entrance arch and pedimented rear portico. Roof lanterns and capitals replace individual carvings.",
    "The rotunda, galleries and court share one grade. Artworks, fountains, inscriptions, underground galleries and the surrounding park are omitted.",
    "The museum photographs show six front portico columns under a level entablature, a rear cupola no wider than the drum, and modest strips of skylights on the two long roofs. The entrance arch mouldings extend to the paving and the broad portico steps are joined to the terrace."
  ],
